 * for a scan. Applied on read (see lib/environment/domain-overrides.ts) so a
 * re-scan never clobbers them and the original AI signal is preserved.
 *
 * `scope` is one of table | schema | catalog; `target` is the matching FQN
 * (table), `catalog.schema` (schema), or `catalog` (catalog). `action` is
 * remap (reassign domain/subdomain) or evict (hide from the estate map).
